  "bio": "Dylan C is a highly skilled tattoo artist specializing in fineline and black&gray styles, proudly serving the Montreal, Canada area. Clients consistently praise Dylan C for the immaculate cleanliness maintained in the studio, ensuring a safe and hygienic environment for every tattoo session. Whether you seek intricate details or elegant grayscale designs, your expectations will be met with an unwavering commitment to a clean and professional tattooing experience.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Montreal, Quebec, Canada"
